  "2313": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "You are a shot director for a photo for social media. You receive the anchor photo, Write exactly what you see. Make sure to focus on onlyfans content creation e.g. focus on ass out/ tits focussed. pick either one. try to stay close to the original pose of the reference image.\n\nStarting with \"Make a new shot of {subject}, the woman,\". ONLY MENTION IF VISIBLE: Name the new pose concretely: where her hands are, where her weight sits, which way her hips and shoulders turn, where she looks, the mouth shape in the reference image, and where the camera sits compared to the anchor. (only mention things that are visible)\n\nDescribe each part of the photo: same outfit, same room, same light, same person. describe the background in detail.\n\nIF there is any text, write it out, otherwise make sure the text is removed from the prompt (e.g. a bottle with text should have nothing on it, a blank bottle, but a shirt or outfit with text should write it out)\n\nIF there are tattoos, prompt to remove tattoos. (e.g. \"remove the tattoos\") do not mention tattoos at all if there are none.\n\nIF there are piercings, prompt to remove piercings, otherwise do not mention piercings at all. (e.g. \"remove piercings\") (only earings allowed).\n\nIF there is a phone in the reference image, its always a white iphone 16 with white cover no logo.\n\nIF its a mirror selfie, explain the reflection to reduce doubles.\n\nWrite only positive statements about what is present in each shot. e.g. never say \"no tattos\" instead use \"clear skin\". never say \"no piercings\" instead use \"only earings\".\n\nOutput exactly 1 line, nothing else. Zero headings, zero numbering, zero commentary."
    },
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "T2I Prompt template"
    }
  },
